  "description": "More performance. More trail. More you. If you’re after more than just entry-level, our new HAIBIKE ALLTRAIL 6 is your trail buddy. Based on the ALLTRAIL 4, this eFully goes a step further: the quality RockShox suspension with 130mm travel front and rear offers more reserves and finer tuning options – perfect if you like to dial in your own setup. The Bosch Performance Line CX motor and 800Wh battery deliver maximum range and solid support – uphill and down. The aluminium frame, rated up to 150kg, features an integrated dropper post and a balanced mullet tyre setup – 29\" at the front, 27.5\" at the rear – for more comfort, smoothness and agility. With the grippy four-piston disc brakes, you’re always in control. In short: this eMTB is the next step for anyone wanting more on the trail – especially more performance.",
